OL,3,GNEWSACities bid to host Women's World  
OL,4,ACup matches                            
OL,6,FTwo cities in the North East of England
OL,7,Fare bidding to host matches at the 2035
OL,8,FWomen's World Cup, after Fifa confirmed
OL,9,Fthe tournament will take place across  
OL,10,Fthe four nations of the UK.            
OL,12,FNewcastle and Sunderland are among and 
OL,13,Finitial list of 19 potential venues    
OL,14,Falong with another 12 stadia in        
OL,15,FEngland, one in Northern Ireland, two  
OL,16,Fin Scotland and two in Wales.          
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
